{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231100","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1023110001:1":{"text":"아, 어르신. 안녕하세요!","source_cn":"嘿，老人家，您好啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA137B955B08A7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1023110002:1":{"text":"안녕 못하네! 자네들도 좋은 사람 같아 보이진 않으니, 내 문앞에서 저리 꺼지게!","source_cn":"我不好，你看起来也不像什么好人！赶紧离开我的家门口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE0B11C136423FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023110003:1":{"text":"어르신, 진정하세요... 저희는 그냥 지나가던 여행자입니다. 물 좀 얻어 마실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"老人家，不要这么激动嘛……我们只是路过的旅人，想喝口水...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D7B3DCC70B86B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023110004:1":{"text":"다들 귀가 먹었나? <shk>당장 꺼지게! 여기에는 아무것도 없어!</shk>","source_cn":"你们是聋子吗？<shk>走开、走开！我这儿什么也没有！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F27CFE3D5EB916","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023110005:1":{"text":"윽... 고집이 장난 아니군요. 로리엣 만나기는 힘들 것 같은데...","source_cn":"唔……他这么固执，我们很难见到罗丽叶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDCAB59A81630D30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023110006:1":{"text":"로리엣! 누가 나와도 된다고 했지? 얌전히 집 안에 있으라고 하지 않았느냐!","source_cn":"罗丽叶！谁让你出来了？我不是让你待在屋子里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7A898DFFE70B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023110007:2":{"text":"그저 지나가던 여행자들이니 쓸데없는 생각하지 마! 줄리오 그 가난뱅이는 다시는 오지 않을 테니!!","source_cn":"别做白日梦了，只是几个路过的外乡人。朱密欧那个穷小子再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96049E11D9C8D955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023110008:1":{"text":"(로리엣인가봐요! 어쩌면 이게 편지를 전달할 수 있는 마지막 기회일지도 몰라요!)","source_cn":"（她就是罗丽叶！——这可能是我们能把信交给她的唯一机会了！）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0180F355783495D1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(로리엣인가봐요! 어쩌면 이게 편지를 전달할 수 있는 마지막 기회일지도 몰라요!)","female":"(로리엣인가봐요! 어쩌면 이게 편지를 전달할 수 있는 마지막 기회일지도 몰라요!)","variant_male_record_index":"97309","variant_female_record_index":"97310","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1023110008":{"text":"(로리엣인가봐요! 어쩌면 이게 편지를 전달할 수 있는 마지막 기회일지도 몰라요!)","source_cn":"（她就是罗丽叶！——这可能是我们能把信交给她的唯一机会了！）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0180F355783495D1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(로리엣인가봐요! 어쩌면 이게 편지를 전달할 수 있는 마지막 기회일지도 몰라요!)","female":"(로리엣인가봐요! 어쩌면 이게 편지를 전달할 수 있는 마지막 기회일지도 몰라요!)","variant_male_record_index":"97309","variant_female_record_index":"97310","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1023110009:1":{"text":"이건... 줄리오의 글씨예요! 아, 줄리오, 당신이 너무 보고 싶지만 이렇게밖에 느낄 수 없다니...","source_cn":"这是……是朱密欧的字迹！啊，我的朱密欧，我多么想见你，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4CB1794DDD87735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1023110010:1":{"text":"또 그 빌어먹을 가난뱅이 자식이 꾸민 짓이구나! 역시 여행자가 아니라 꿍꿍이가 있는 놈들이었어!","source_cn":"又是那个该死的穷小子搞的花样！你们这些外乡人，果然没安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x340F8E2954FF984E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1023110011:1":{"text":"<shk>어, 잠깐만요!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>喂——住手！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC15AB8132008BC06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1023110012:2":{"text":"<shk>편지를 찢었어요!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>他把情书给撕了！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6ACE4DC7C577E63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1023110013:1":{"text":"<shk>이건 줄리오가 저에게 보낸 편지예요!</shk> 아버지가 뭐라고 이걸 찢어요!","source_cn":"<shk>这是朱密欧写给我的信！</shk>你凭什么撕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3DBC8498F6DBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1023110014:1":{"text":"전부 다 너를 위해서야! 그 사기꾼에게 속아 넘어가서는 안 된다!","source_cn":"我现在做的一切都是为了你——不被那个只会花言巧语的骗子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23C83ED64EED2CF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1023110015:1":{"text":"그놈이 너를 사랑해서 사탕발림한다고 생각하지 말아라!","source_cn":"别以为他是因为爱你才给你写那些肉麻话，天真的小姑娘！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4860E16FDD54568D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1023110016:1":{"text":"분명 재산을 노리고 접근한 게 틀림없어. 돈 한 푼 없는 놈이 어떻게 널 행복하게 해줄 수 있단 말이냐!","source_cn":"他分明是觊觎我们辛苦操劳半辈子得来的财富，没有帷帐和金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800A71269356B37D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1023110017:1":{"text":"가자! 그 녀석과 절대 만날 일 없으니!","source_cn":"你跟我回去！我是不会让你有机会和那个混小子私会的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDD8CCD556EEB40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1023110018:1":{"text":"이거 놔요!\n...줄리오를 만나러 가겠어요! 꼭 만나야 겠다고요...","source_cn":"你放开我！\\n——我要去找朱密欧！我要去找他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A9FBB5B3EC71545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1023110019:1":{"text":"...참견하는 결 좋아하는 편은 아닌데, 저 어르신은 정말 완고하네요.","source_cn":"……我不喜欢惹麻烦，但这位老先生太不近人情了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC074E4FBD12584E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1023110020:1":{"text":"어쩌죠? 편지도 찢어졌고... 줄리오에게 이 사실을 알려야 할까요?","source_cn":"现在怎么办？情书也被撕了……要把事情的原委告诉朱密欧吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76358202F83B2B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1023110020":{"text":"어쩌죠? 편지도 찢어졌고... 줄리오에게 이 사실을 알려야 할까요?","source_cn":"现在怎么办？情书也被撕了……要把事情的原委告诉朱密欧吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76358202F83B2B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1023110021:1":{"text":"으으으, 치피의 얼굴로 뭔가 날아왔어요!","source_cn":"唔唔唔唔！有什么东西飞到满满脸上了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3440656BCA6BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1023110022:1":{"text":"이게 뭐지... 종잇조각? 위에 뭐라고 적혀있는 거 같아요...","source_cn":"这是什么……一张小纸片？上面还写着什么风，什么鱼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DFC31A5161A2515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1023110023:1":{"text":"...연애편지네요!","source_cn":"——是那封情书！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F4BD28C4437A81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1023110023":{"text":"...연애편지네요!","source_cn":"——是那封情书！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F4BD28C4437A81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1023110024:1":{"text":"음... 치피가 해볼게요! 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"唔……满满可以试试！就交给我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B4873F3E787ECFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"치피, 다른 조각도 찾을 수 있겠어?","source_cn":"满满，你还能找到其他碎片吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x93E15E28AC99A4F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"치피, 다른 조각도 찾을 수 있겠어?","female":"치피, 다른 조각도 찾을 수 있겠어?","variant_male_record_index":"58616","variant_female_record_index":"58617","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"줄리오가 슬퍼할 텐데...","source_cn":"朱密欧一定会很伤心的……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF0B120BB17BAAAE9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"줄리오가 슬퍼할 텐데...","female":"줄리오가 슬퍼할 텐데...","variant_male_record_index":"58612","variant_female_record_index":"58613","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:1:2":{"text":"어쩌면 다른 방법이 있을지도 몰라...","source_cn":"或许还有别的办法……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7DB527524F7BA1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어쩌면 다른 방법이 있을지도 몰라...","female":"어쩌면 다른 방법이 있을지도 몰라...","variant_male_record_index":"58614","variant_female_record_index":"58615","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"로리엣 양, 여기 편지","source_cn":"罗丽叶小姐，这里有你的信","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDBCE675E26654A00","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"로리엣 양, 여기 편지","female":"로리엣 양, 여기 편지","variant_male_record_index":"58610","variant_female_record_index":"58611","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贾尔丹":{"text":"자르단","source":"贾尔丹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗丽叶":{"text":"로리엣","source":"罗丽叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":32,"localized_text_count":31,"speaker_count":5}}